               ~~NONFOODDIC_DICT.PSU~~</span></td><td><span style="font-size: 14px;">~~NONFOODDIC_DICT.SSU~~</span></td><td><span style="font-size: 14px;">~~NONFOODDIC_DICT.HH~~</span></td></tr></tbody></table>
            
            <p><b>~~sectionHeadingNF()~~</b></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">**නොමිලේ ලැබුණු / තෑග්ගක් ලෙස ලැබුණු&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~~getvaluelabel(C426)~~</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">&nbsp;යේ වටිනාකම (රු.)</span><b></b></p><p></p>
          TA: |
